# qt opens Quick Add on the TODAY project, even one with tags, and Enter adds the task as its last child.
file <<END
Work:
	- Email boss
TODAY: @star
	- Stand-up
END
keys qt
see Quick Add → TODAY
type Water plants
keys <Enter>
status Added to TODAY
quit
saved <<END
Work:
	- Email boss
TODAY: @star
	- Stand-up
	- Water plants
END
